Fear spell, which to his dismay, he finds he is too weak to cast. Gandalf's pet
housecat Stimpy (another original name) wisely steers clear of said minotaur. After the minotaur's attack Gandalf has few options: engrave Elbereth, which doesn't work against minotaurs, running, which doesn't work since the stairs are too far away, or attacking. Needless to say, Gandalf missed and was promptly killed.
